---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import EmailObfuscationEscape from "../components/EmailObfuscationEscape.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact cueloop"
  description="Support, security, documentation, and project contact details for cueloop."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><a href="/">← cueloop</a></p>
        <h1>Contact cueloop</h1>
        <p>
          Start with the <a href="/docs/">cueloop documentation</a> for installation, agent
          integrations, commands, configuration, keyboard controls, sharing, and security. The docs
          are the fastest way to answer setup and usage questions.
        </p>
        <h2>Support and questions</h2>
        <p>
          Email <EmailObfuscationEscape><a href="mailto:hello@cueloop.dev"
            >hello@cueloop.dev</a
          ></EmailObfuscationEscape> for private support or questions about the project. For
          reproducible bugs and feature requests, open an issue in the <a
            href="https://github.com/mmurakaru/cueloop/issues">public issue tracker</a
          >. Include the cueloop version, operating system, command you ran, and the smallest example
          that shows the problem. Do not include source code, tokens, private repository URLs, or
          other secrets.
        </p>
        <h2>Security reports</h2>
        <p>
          Send security reports by email instead of opening a public issue. Explain the affected
          version, the impact, and how to reproduce the problem. Reports are reviewed before details
          are shared publicly.
        </p>
        <h2>Project links</h2>
        <p>
          The source code, current work, and release history are available on
          <a href="https://github.com/mmurakaru/cueloop">GitHub</a>. cueloop is an open-source project,
          not a staffed support service, so response times can vary.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
